  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the cod fillets and pat them dry with paper towels.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a large tagine pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced onion and cook until it's translucent and slightly caramelized.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the brine-dried fish, shredded coconut, salt-free seasoning blend, and black pepper.",
    "Stir well to combine and cook for 2-3 minutes.",
    "Add the cod fillets and stir gently to distribute the flavors.",
    "Add the lemon juice and stir gently to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 8-10 minutes, or until the fish is cooked through.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley and cilantro. Serve hot.",
    "Serve the fish tagine with steamed vegetables or a side salad.",
    "Garnish with additional parsley and lemon wedges, if desired."
